# Large public datasets â€” fetched locally, never committed
raw/**

# ...but hand-authored policy / SOP markdown is SOURCE, not a fetched dataset.
# It cannot be re-downloaded, and without it a fresh clone cannot rebuild a
# tenant's RAG corpus — the demo comes up with an empty policy library and
# every grounded answer silently loses its citations.
!raw/policy/
!raw/policy/*.md

# Local Python env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Credentials (always set via env, never committed)
*.secret.json

# Workflow exports we haven't promoted yet
workflows/_draft/
